    {
      "id": "closed",
      "title": "1. Items Claude has closed",
      "icon": "check",
      "description": "Your first question is the first row.  Each row:  what the colour would mean to you, and what you'd do when you see it."
    },
    {
      "id": "you",
      "title": "2. Waiting on you",
      "icon": "flag",
      "description": "Red means the work can't go on without you.  Orange means your turn to read, review or pick."
    },
    {
      "id": "calm",
      "title": "3. Open, but nothing to think about",
      "icon": "circle outline",
      "description": "Where most of the yellows are today:  in the epics still open, 625 of 952 yellow chips are calm judgement calls."
    },
    {
      "id": "phase",
      "title": "4. Phases and epics",
      "icon": "list",
      "description": "Mostly as you set them on 2026-10-29."
    },
    {
      "id": "buttons",
      "title": "5. Buttons, marks and small signals",
      "icon": "bullseye",
      "description": "The rest, for completeness.  Mostly staying as they are."
    }
